<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Tanabe to issue 8 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Tanabe to issue 8 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Tokyo Tanabe Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   8 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Mar.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 6.Jan.97   CONV TO 30.Mar.06</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 6.Dec.96   INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 28.Nov-5.Dec</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  BBB	LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on November 27.</p>
</text>
